; Exposed brick/lath under a fallen-plaster patch — the dull brick-red/dark-
; brown the concept art's material board carries under every plaster loss.
; Low-chroma and low-value so it never competes with props/red_mat's
; extinguisher, the kit's one deliberate saturated accent — but NOT as dark
; as the first pass (0.30/0.16/0.12), which read as near-black maroon against
; the ward's fog and lost the brick entirely, closer to a dried stain than a
; masonry surface. Lifted and warmed so the hue reads as brick even under the
; UNMED fog this prop is meant to be seen through.
;
; Palette pass (2026-08): 0.30/0.16/0.12 -> 0.38/0.21/0.16, confirmed against
; fallen_plaster_patch's own gallery shot.

